[node name="ControlsDialog" type="AcceptDialog" parent="."]
title = "Campus Explorer — Controls Reference"
size = Vector2i(460, 280)
dialog_text = "• Movement: W, A, S, D or Arrow Keys
• Sprint: Left Shift (Hold for 1.8x speed)
• Jump: Spacebar
• Camera Look: Move Mouse
• Interact: E (Talk to Prof. Sharma, pick up ID card, open doors)
• Pause / Menu: Escape or Q

Explore the campus entrance, collect your student ID card, and visit the classrooms and grand staircase!"
